    "explanation": "To both parties: the SGD 8.00 cancellation fee does not stand and is refunded to the rider in full.\n\nThe driver did arrive. The GPS trace places him about 24 m from the Plaza Singapura ride-hail bay pin — far inside the 120 m arrival radius that applies to a LARGE_VENUE pickup — stationary at 0 km/h across all 25 fixes, and the trip record carries a driver 'arrived' event. Limbs (a) and (b) of POL-NS-01 are therefore met, and there is no false arrival marker under POL-NS-05: at the 'arrived' timestamp the driver was neither more than 300 m from the pin nor moving at 15 km/h or above. The driver's account that he was present at the correct bay is corroborated, and the rider's 519 m distance from the pin confirms this is not a wrong-entrance case under POL-NS-03.\n\nThe fee nonetheless fails on the waiting period. POL-NS-01 limb (c) requires a continuous in-geofence hold of at least the zone minimum — 300 seconds for LARGE_VENUE — measured from the first qualifying in-geofence fix (17:15:00), not from the 'arrived' tap (17:15:20). The trace measures a single continuous hold of 240 seconds, a 60-second shortfall. Limb (c) fails, and under POL-NS-06 — which is strict liability and does not depend on where the rider was or whether she answered — the cancellation fee is refunded in full. Only one in-geofence interval exists, so POL-NS-06(i) accumulation cannot apply, and it could not apply in any event: the traffic advisory EV-ADVIS-09103-01 is MISSING (issue code MISSING_ARTIFACT, weight 0.0), and a missing artifact can carry no fact and cannot be asserted to excuse the shortfall.\n\nThe rider's own conduct does not change the refund. She was about 519 m from the pin with zero qualifying fixes and sent no locating or coordinating message, so POL-NS-04 does not exonerate her — but POL-NS-06 does not turn on that, and that route was never needed.\n\nThe driver receives no compensation. POL-NS-07 pays only where POL-NS-01 is satisfied in full, and it is not; a 240-second hold earns nothing. The anti-farming check does not trip (no_show_terminations_30d of 1 and a 1/120 rate of 0.008, both below their thresholds), so compensation is not withheld on that ground either — it is simply not payable.\n\nNo referral and no escalation. The arrival, dwell and rider-presence readings are mutually consistent; the bundle is clean under POL-NS-08(a)–(d) (the 'arrived' event sits on a GPS fix, no gap exceeds 120 s, the chat holds exactly the 3 messages the trip record reports, and SGD 8.00 is the greater of the SGD 4.00 zone-class and SGD 8.00 RYDE_XL vehicle-tier fee); and no POL-NS-09 trigger fires, the deciding fact being carried by a COMPLETE artifact at weight 1.0. The 60-second shortfall is a timing defect by a driver who was present and willing at the correct bay; it is recorded here as exactly that and not as misconduct, and it produces no adverse finding against him.",
